-- 1. Which critters live at Lily Pond?
--    Find its id in the Tables tab first.
SELECT name FROM critters;

-- 2. Fern the deer is moving into a brand new
--    home, Mossy Log. Run this and read the
--    red message: the order is a problem!
INSERT INTO critters (name, kind, home_id)
VALUES ('Fern', 'deer', 4);

INSERT INTO homes (id, name, place)
VALUES (4, 'Mossy Log', 'woods');

hints.markdown:
The two `WHERE` lines are:

```sql
WHERE age > (SELECT AVG(age) FROM critters);

WHERE home_id IN
  (SELECT id FROM homes WHERE place = 'tree');
```

